Gear lookup tables (src/gear_table/gear32.rs and gear64.rs)
-----------------------------------------------------------

The 64-bit table is reproduced from rsroll; the 32-bit table consists of
the upper 32 bits of each 64-bit entry. The original table was introduced
by Dawid Ciezarkiewicz in commit 373bd64080def4ad0464961d612a1e8e4a2f88c0.
Source: https://github.com/aidanhs/rsroll/blob/373bd64080def4ad0464961d612a1e8e4a2f88c0/src/_gear_rand.rs
